{"candidateAnswer":"A standardized assessment related to his career goals","evidence":"[D8:18 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] John: Wow, having symbols of travel memories in our homes is so cool! Last week I retook the aptitude test with some great results, and I feel drawn to serving my country in this way.\n[D3:11 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: Thanks, Maria! I really appreciate your support, It means a lot to me. Especially after I failed the military aptitude test recently, I've been feeling a bit stressed out.","itemId":"urn:uuid:62fa2a54-8778-5e0c-83b1-b814cf7e9ebd","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:3d9f08d1057d25642fb01c125076875b0e85a4f0e27718020cc67d33890e7d74","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What test has John taken multiple times?","referenceAnswer":"The military aptitude test","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"3d9f08d1057d25642fb01c125076875b0e85a4f0e27718020cc67d33890e7d74"}}]}